[Trigger]
Name	smoulder
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	The Ashcombe valley still smokes from an old fire, master, and Warden Liesl Ashby has mounted her wagons to flee over the northern pass. You have most of an hour before she is gone.
Action	objective	1	Kill Warden Liesl Ashby before she escapes the valley.
Action	objective	1	Cross the ash basin and find the northern hold.
Action	order	wait	2	-	LieslAshby
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	basinEntered
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Basin
Action	message	1	The ash is deep here and the lava cracks run in all directions. Her sentries watch the dunes, so keep your creatures close together.
Action	reveal	1	Trail
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	ruinsFound
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	RuinYard
Action	message	1	These ruins were a mill once. Their stores are intact, and there is a way north behind them.
Action	reveal	1	NorthHall
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hollowFound
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	EastHollow
Action	message	1	The east hollow joins the warden road from below. Gold lies in its walls, if you can hold it.
Action	reveal	1	Approach
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	wagonsMoving
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Approach
Action	message	1	Her wagons are being loaded! Ashby will leave the hold in five minutes and run for the south road.
Action	spawn	3	76	22	1	Knight:2	Elf:2	Adventurer:2	Monk:2
Action	objective	1	Break into the hold before the wagons leave, or catch Ashby on the road.
Action	setflag	fleeing	1
Action	timer	wagonClock	0
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	holdBreached
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Hold
Action	message	1	You are in her hold. Ashby is somewhere in the great hall, and her best are with her.
Action	spawn	3	80	12	1	Knight:3	Knight:2	Monk:2	Dwarf2:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	firstEmber
Mode	once
Cond	time	480
Action	message	1	Ash-stained patrols are crossing the basin towards you.
Action	spawn	3	40	52	1	Adventurer:2	Dwarf1:2	Elf:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	secondEmber
Mode	once
Cond	time	1000
Action	message	1	A heavier column marches down the south road.
Action	spawn	3	62	62	1	Knight:2	Adventurer:2	Monk:2	Dwarf1:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	thirdEmber
Mode	once
Cond	time	1700
Action	message	1	The valley is rising against you. Fighters are coming from the old mill.
Action	spawn	3	24	22	1	Knight:3	Elf:2	Dwarf2:2	Monk:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	fourthEmber
Mode	once
Cond	time	2300
Action	message	1	Ashby has called back everything she has left.
Action	spawn	3	46	12	1	Knight:3	Knight:3	Elf:3	Adventurer:3	Monk:3
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	wagonLeaves
Mode	once
Cond	flag	fleeing	1
Cond	timer	wagonClock	>=	300
Cond	alive	LieslAshby
Action	message	1	The wagons are out of the gate! Ashby is making for the south road. Cut her off.
Action	order	goto	2	82,18;83,24;84,30;87,36;84,45;81,49;78,52;75,55;63,56	LieslAshby
Action	speed	run	LieslAshby
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	wardenEscaped
Mode	once
Cond	reached	LieslAshby	region	ExitRoad
Action	message	1	Ashby has reached the south road and her wagons are gone. Ashcombe is lost.
Action	lose	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	wardenDown
Mode	once
Cond	event	LieslAshby	killed
Action	message	1	Liesl Ashby has fallen before her wagons could leave. The ashes of Ashcombe are yours.
Action	win	1
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
